diagnostic forbidden_mutation EFFECTS CHECK_MUTATION_GRANT FORBIDDEN_MUTATION_ESCAPES_GRANT EFFECT_ESCALATION REJECT_CALL_PATH CALL_PATH
diagnostic missing_indirect_grant GRANTS CHECK_CALLEE_GRANT INDIRECT_GRANT_MISSING INDIRECT_GRANT DECLARE_CALLEE_GRANT CALLEE_GRANT
