diagnostic unknown_call_target GRAPH RESOLVE_CALL_TARGET CALL_TARGET_MISSING UNRESOLVED_CALL DECLARE_TARGET CALL_TARGET
diagnostic call_graph_cycle GRAPH CHECK_CALL_GRAPH_CYCLE CALL_GRAPH_CYCLE GRAPH_CYCLE REPAIR_CALL_GRAPH CALL_PATH

